data: {"type":"user-message-appended","userMessage":{"type":"user_message","session_id":"run-3682dc84-f3e8-42d8-9b81-4a5f0c445aed","text":"Hello Cursor cloud agent, tell me all the tools you have access to. Write all the tool names, one per line, exactly as they are named in your tool definitions, to the file ./tools.txt.\n\nThen please use each of the tools in ./tools.txt that is available in this environment, one-by-one, to show me how they work (read a file, list a directory, search for text, search for files by glob, run a shell command, create a file, edit a file, delete a file, fetch a web page or search the web, write a todo list, and any others you have). Keep each use small. Identify any tools you cannot exercise and explain why. Do not commit or push. Finish with a summary table of tool name and whether you exercised it."}}

